{"id":"5487","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5487_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-mamma_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>照片摄于11300米高空，为孤立的积雨云云顶。由于其顶部扁平且呈纤维状，因此，我们认为是鬃云种。此云在对流层顶<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">扁平呈砧状(1)</span>，表明为砧状附加特征，但此外，白色云高于砧状云，这表明 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">剧烈对流正超过</span> 对流层顶。紧靠砧状云下方，我们可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">悬球状附加特征的乳状隆起</span>。在更低的大气层中有大量小的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Marcin Kocybik","location":"保加利亚西南部上空","latitude":"纬度: 41° 45' 50'' N","longitude":"经度: 23° 15' 49'' E","date":"15 August 2015 1834 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.16.10.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.16.10.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5487_upper_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-mamma_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1200 UTC从保加利亚索菲亚进行的探测，距航拍照片以北约100公里，显示大气极不稳定，在700至500 hPa之间有水汽。对流层顶高度约为200 hPa（12200米）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}